		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Scarlet, four-armed hybrid of insect and reptile with egg- implanting mandibles.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 claw +4 (1d6) and 1 bite +4 (1d10 + implant), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ethereal Shift</strong>. Can shift into Ethereal Plane or back into mortal realm, takes 1d4 rounds during which xill cannot act or move.</p><p></p><p><strong>Implant</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d4 CON damage (cannot heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, spawning 2d6 xill which burst from the abdomen.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
